# The Vercel deploy serves the repo root so that `vercel.json` can live here and
# no dashboard Root Directory setting is needed. Everything except the web
# surface is therefore excluded explicitly — without this, the vision doc, the
# domain glossary and the entire app and prototype source would be publicly
# fetchable at their repo paths.
#
# Deny by default, then re-allow the surface. `app/src/__tests__/web-surface.test.ts`
# fails if a new top-level entry appears that is neither ignored nor part of the
# surface, so adding a directory to the repo cannot silently publish it.
*

!web/
!web/**
!vercel.json
